! WP-U1.4 (UPGRADE_PLAN §WP-U1.4) — LineSpacing equivalent-spacing model.
! A LineSpacing with detailed=no supplies the four equivalent distances
! (EqDistPhPh/EqDistPhN/AvgPhaseHeight/AvgNeutralHeight) instead of per-conductor
! X/H coordinates; the LineGeometry (nconds=4, nphases=3, reduce=y) Kron-reduces
! to a 3x3 phase Z/Yc. oracle capi015 (0.15.x LineSpacing.pas/LineConstants.pas).
! YPrim-focused live compare on line.l1 (the asymmetric-family convention).
Clear
New Circuit.linecs_eq basekv=12.47 phases=3 bus1=sourcebus
New WireData.acsr gmrac=0.0244 diam=0.721 rac=0.306 runits=mi radunits=in gmrunits=ft normamps=530
New LineSpacing.sp nconds=4 nphases=3 units=ft detailed=no EqDistPhPh=2.5 EqDistPhN=4.272 AvgPhaseHeight=28.0 AvgNeutralHeight=24.0
New LineGeometry.g nconds=4 nphases=3 spacing=sp wires=[acsr acsr acsr acsr] reduce=y
New Line.l1 bus1=sourcebus bus2=b2 geometry=g length=1 units=mi
New Load.ld bus1=b2 phases=3 kv=12.47 kw=1000 pf=0.95
Set voltagebases=[12.47]
Calcvoltagebases
